From: sarun <noreply@sarun>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:20:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add a portable Unix event loop

Retain epoll on Linux and Android, and provide an equivalent poll-based worker plus shared readiness flags for Darwin hosts.

